            "action_name": {
              "value": "Dweomer Leap"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, conjuration, teleportation)\n\nThe dweomercat casts dimension door, then can make a melee Strike against one creature adjacent to it at the end of its teleport. If the dweomercat ends its teleport adjacent to a creature under an ongoing spell effect or who cast a spell since the dweomercat's last turn, this does not expend a casting of dimension door."
            },
